{smcl}
{com}{sf}{ul off}{txt}
{com}. 
. use "E:\16GBBACKUPUSB\BACKUP_USB_SEPTEMBER2014\May Baydoun_folder\UK_BIOBANK_PROJECT\UKB_PAPER11_NFLGFAPDEMPDMORT_METAB\DATA\finaldata_unimputedfin_MULTISTATE",clear
{txt}
{com}. 
. 
. * Install estout if not already installed
. ssc install estout, replace
{txt}checking {hilite:estout} consistency and verifying not already installed...
all files already exist and are up to date.

{com}. 
. * Clear any previous estimates
. est clear
{res}{txt}
{com}. 
. * Start the loop
. foreach x of varlist neflbr gfapbr  {c -(} 
{txt}  2{com}.     * Loop over zMETAB variables
.     foreach metab of numlist 1/15 {c -(}
{txt}  3{com}.         foreach k of numlist 1/3 {c -(}
{txt}  4{com}.         * Run the streg command
.         streg c.zMETAB`metab'##c.`x' zLE8_TOTALSCOREinv SEX AGE NonWhite householdsize SESres ztownsend comorbid srhbr if sample_final==1 & _trans`k'==1, distribution(weibull)
{txt}  5{com}.         
.         * Store the estimates
.         eststo metab`metab'_`x'_`k'
{txt}  6{com}.     {c )-}
{txt}  7{com}. {c )-}
{txt}  8{com}. {c )-}

